  "title": "Package Forecast Input",
  "description": "Proposed package for a read-only availability forecast in get_products refine mode (AdCP 3.3). Field shapes and package validation rules are shared with Package Request. The enclosing refine entry supplies product_id; it MUST NOT be repeated here. pricing_option_id and budget are required. The budget uses the selected pricing option's currency, and impressions, when supplied, has its create_media_buy goal semantics. Omitted flight boundaries inherit filters.start_date/end_date; if an exact flight or goal cannot be resolved, the seller reports unable with notes rather than guessing. Targeting inherits the effective discovery configuration and applies package-level per-dimension replacement or clearing exactly as on create. All supplied fields are forecast inputs only: no booking, hold, reservation, creative upload, or assignment is performed.",
